{"last_link_id": 35, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Flux.2 Klein material-faithful product retouch upscale\n\nUse this workflow when the previous Flux.2 Klein version looks good but changes the product material or adds extra text.\n\nDefault model stack:\n- UNET: flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4.safetensors\n- CLIP: qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors, type flux2\n- VAE: flux2-vae.safetensors\n- LoRA: XRJXV4_000003000.safetensors, strength 0.48\n\nMain goal: preserve the original product material, finish, color, texture, printed marks, logos and perspective while cleaning dust, blur haze and compression artifacts. Do not generate, add, rewrite or extend any text."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [720, 380], "pos": [-1580, -720], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2, 3], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [315, 106], "pos": [-1190, -210], "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 2, 64], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscale_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution_steps"}, "name": "resolution_steps", "label": "resolution_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution_steps"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [364, 82], "pos": [