inal product full frame, structure, silhouette, proportions, camera angle, perspective, color zones, layout, logo placement, existing printed mark positions, label region boundaries, buttons, ports, screws, dial marks, material boundaries and all functional details unchanged. Preserve the exact original material type, surface finish, roughness, reflectivity, coating, transparency, color temperature, wear pattern and texture scale. Do not turn matte plastic into glossy plastic, metal into plastic, glass into acrylic, rubber into metal, or brushed metal into mirror chrome. Clean the product into a high-end e-commerce image with restrained realistic studio lighting, gentle highlight recovery, natural reflections, cleaner edges, smoother tonal gradients, neutral white or gray background and natural contact shadows. Remove dust, dirt, speckles, stains, scratches, compression blocks, blur haze, subtitle residue, watermark-like caption traces and background grime. Treat all product text, numbers, labels and logos as protected source-image printed marks. Do not enhance text, do not restore text, do not generate typography, do not add new letters, numbers, words, symbols, labels, brand marks, serial numbers or captions. If text is unreadable or blurry in the source image, keep it as the same unreadable print-like shapes in the same positions instead of guessing. Preserve exact geometry and do not redesign the product."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 7, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Product Retouch)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [650, 330], "pos": [-780, -450], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [13], "label": "COND